# Git commits

When creating git commits in this project:

- NEVER add `Co-authored-by: Cursor` or any Cursor co-author trailer to commit messages.
- NEVER add `Co-authored-by: cursoragent@cursor.com` or similar.
- Commits must be authored only by the user — use a plain commit message with no co-author lines.
- Only create commits when the user explicitly asks.

This keeps Cursor off the GitHub contributors list.
